00:07:23.810 --> 00:07:25.100
the Get Ready For Ratios unit.

00:07:25.100 --> 00:07:26.610
You could even use them at the same time.

00:07:26.610 --> 00:07:27.730
You could you know,

00:07:27.730 --> 00:07:30.020
simultaneously be working
on sixth grade ratios

00:07:30.020 --> 00:07:32.250
