00:07:33.422 --> 00:07:35.960
Or you could do it one after the other.

00:07:35.960 --> 00:07:37.000
So I think there's a model

00:07:37.000 --> 00:07:39.110
where you could do the
whole thing upfront,

00:07:39.110 --> 00:07:41.403
but really for teachers
and during the school year,

00:07:41.403 --> 00:07:44.280
I think there's an enormous
advantage to doing it during,

00:07:44.280 --> 00:07:45.520
